{"id":"n75761-1-7","stage":1,"title":"저쪽 · 那边","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75761-1-7-1","ko":"우리가 찾는 곳이 어디인지 물어봤어?","zh":"你问过我们要找的地方在哪儿了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"찾는","meaning":"拜访，寻访，探访","explanation":"찾다：拜访，寻访，探访；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"5","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾는","audio":"/audio/cea6f2919cf4bac1de7e.mp3"}},{"text":"곳이","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳이","audio":"/audio/425fee6379fd1e4146b7.mp3"}},{"text":"어디인지","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디인지","audio":"/audio/aacc67524b32e471fc9e.mp3"}},{"text":"물어봤어?","meaning":"问，打听","explanation":"물어보다：问，打听；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"물어보다","audio":"/audio/d3dc601f766896a3ecf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69473","senseId":"1","lemma":"물어보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물어봤어","audio":"/audio/d48f198bd15540fdf06b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"拜访，寻访，探访","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了见某人或看某地而去相关场所。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"d3dc601f766896a3","term":"물어보다","zh":"问，打听","audio":"/audio/d3dc601f766896a3ecf1.mp3","entryId":"69473","definition":"为弄清某事而发问。","pronunciation":["무러보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ea3ee9b5e279d7547c20.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75761-1-7-2","ko":"응. 바로 저쪽에 있는 큰 건물이래.","zh":"嗯，说是就在那边那栋大楼里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"바로","meaning":"正，就","explanation":"바로：正，就","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"6","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}},{"text":"저쪽에","meaning":"那边","explanation":"저쪽：那边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저쪽","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75761","senseId":"1","lemma":"저쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저쪽에","audio":"/audio/0056568e730234185be4.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"건물이래.","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건물이래","audio":"/audio/9e888631dfa7b02e6ee2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"a441b444c56119c0","term":"바로","zh":"正，就","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3","entryId":"64744","definition":"不是别的，正是。","pronunciation":["바로"]},{"id":"db084e1f145d7643","term":"저쪽","zh":"那边","audio":"/audio/db084e1f145d7643d7ae.mp3","entryId":"75761","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人远的地方或方向。","pronunciation":["저쪽"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3","entryId":"28029","definition":"为住人、做事或保管东西而建造的有墙壁和屋顶的构造物。","pronunciation":["건ː물"]}],"audio":"/audio/8a3691aff56ec3fe21a4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75761","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词